    {
      "id": 44,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -460,
        260
      ],
      "size": [
        480,
        210
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 43,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## How to use\n1. Pick the **MODE** switch (orange node): **OFF = TEXT→PANO** (Krea 2 generates the pano from the scene prompt) · **ON = IMAGE→PANO** (your photo is converted to a 360 pano by Qwen-Edit + the 360 LoRA).\n2. Always describe the scene in the green **SCENE PROMPT** — in image mode it drives the Krea refine + seam fix, so describe *your photo*.\n3. Queue. The result lands in `output/SplatKit/` and feeds straight into SplatKit workflow `1_camera_plot_flythrough`."
      ],
      "color": "#233",
      "bgcolor": "#355"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -460,
        510
      ],
      "size": [
        480,
        240
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 44,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Krea 2** → 📁 `diffusion_models`\n- [krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors) — most GPUs\n- [krea2_turbo_nvfp4](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_nvfp4.safetensors) — RTX 50xx *(default)*\n\n**Text encoder** → 📁 `text_encoders`: [qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors) (type `krea2`)\n\n**VAE** → 📁 `vae`: [wan_2.1_vae](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors)"
      ],
      "color": "#97651BFF",
      "bgcolor": "#B67921FF"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -460,
        790
      ],
      "size": [
        480,
        260
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 45,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Qwen Image Edit 2511** (image→pano mode) → 📁 `diffusion_models/qwen`\n- [qwen_image_edit_2511_fp8mixed](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-Edit_ComfyUI/tree/main/split_files/diffusion_models)\n\n**Text encoder**: [qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors) (type `qwen_image`) · **VAE**: [qwen_image_vae](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors)\n\n**LoRAs** → 📁 `loras/qwen`: [Lightning 4-step 2511](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Lightning) + **251018_MICKMUMPITZ_QWEN-EDIT_360_03** (own trained 360 LoRA)"
      ],
      "color": "#97651BFF",
      "bgcolor": "#B67921FF"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -460,
        1090
      ],
      "size": [
        480,
        200
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 46,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Why 3 passes?\n- **Qwen 360 LoRA** nails the equirect *geometry* but is soft on detail.\n- **KREA REFINE** (denoise ≈0.35) re-details every pixel without moving the geometry — this is what makes the pano look Krea-quality.\n- **SEAM FIX** rolls the pano 180°, inpaints the wrap seam strip, rolls back → left/right edges match perfectly (important for SplatKit)."
      ],
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    }
  ],
